OL,3,GNEWSA'Growing risk' sweet chestnut
OL,4,Adisease will spread
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe risk of Sweet Chestnut Blight
OL,7,Fspreading has increased significantly
OL,8,Fin parts of south-west England, the
OL,9,FForestry Commission has said.
OL,11,FRestrictions aimed at preventing the
OL,12,Fspread of the disease have been
OL,13,Fextended across parts of Devon and
OL,14,FCornwall with the new area coming into
OL,15,Fforce on 26 August. They expand the
OL,16,Fexisting area in south Devon into the
OL,17,Fwest of the county and into south east
OL,18,FCornwall.
OL,20,FIt follows surveillance which
OL,21,Fdiscovered further infected sites close
OL,22,Fto the existing restricted zone.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
