OL,3,GNEWSA'Growing risk' sweet chestnut
OL,4,Adisease will spread
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrading restrictions on sweet chestnut
OL,7,Ftrees and other chestnut material will
OL,8,Fapply across the expanded area to help
OL,9,Fprevent infected plants and materials
OL,10,Fbeing moved, the commission said.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
